    rdfs:label "[\"stockUsedOnlyDuring\",\"heronStock\",\"floodWinter\"]", "The steward's stock-book is plain: heron paper entered the copy-room in the winter of the flood, and the last of it was spent before the thaw. None before, none since.";
    ms:factJson "[\"stockUsedOnlyDuring\",\"heronStock\",\"floodWinter\"]"^^rdf:JSON.
