    rdfs:label "[\"inkOf\",\"nocturne\",\"galleyBatch\"]", "The draft's ink is the copy-room's own iron-gall — the galley batch, mixed with flood-silted water; it greys at the stroke's edge like no other.";
    ms:factJson "[\"inkOf\",\"nocturne\",\"galleyBatch\"]"^^rdf:JSON.
